\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The hybrid. A comment enters two branches: the neural branch produces class probabilities, the rule branch per-label lexical scores and the spans that produced them. Fusion mixes each channel with its own weight $\alpha _c$, and frozen per-channel thresholds turn the three scores into a label; the evidence record is emitted with the decision. Weights and thresholds shown were selected on validation for the focused backbone.}}{5}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{5}{The hybrid. A comment enters two branches: the neural branch produces class probabilities, the rule branch per-label lexical scores and the spans that produced them. Fusion mixes each channel with its own weight $\alpha _c$, and frozen per-channel thresholds turn the three scores into a label; the evidence record is emitted with the decision. Weights and thresholds shown were selected on validation for the focused backbone}{figure.1}{}}
