\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The four backbones and the paired tests between AI-only and the hybrid. All share the encoder (\texttt  {microsoft/mdeberta-v3-base}), tokenizer, split and evaluation code, differing only in optimisation recipe. $\Delta =\text  {AI}-\text  {hybrid}$ in macro-F1, so negative favours the hybrid; the 95\% interval is the paired-bootstrap percentile over 10{,}000 resamples. $b/c$ are the comments the AI gets right/hybrid wrong and vice versa; the last column is the exact McNemar $p$.}}{7}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
